---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
---

<PageLayout
  title="About Me"
  description="Software Engineer & Distributed Systems Practitioner based in Bangkok, Thailand."
>
  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-10 lg:gap-12 items-start">
    <!-- Left Column: Narrative & Focus Areas -->
    <div class="lg:col-span-7 space-y-10">
      <section id="about" class="bg-white border border-zinc-200 rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-xs">
        <div class="prose prose-zinc lg:prose-lg max-w-none text-zinc-700 leading-relaxed">
          <p class="text-xl font-bold text-zinc-950 mt-0 mb-4">Hello, I'm Jo.</p>
          <p>
            I am <strong>Jirawat Boonkumnerd</strong>, a Software Engineer from Thailand focused on systems programming, distributed consensus, network performance, and developer tooling.
          </p>
          <p class="mb-0">
            I build lean, high-throughput architectures using Go, TypeScript, WebRTC, and Astro. On this site, I publish deep technical analyses covering PostgreSQL indexing internals, Node.js stream pipelines, peer-to-peer protocols, and static web infrastructure.
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Engineering Focus Areas -->
      <section aria-labelledby="focus-heading">
        <h2 id="focus-heading" class="text-xs font-mono font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-zinc-600 mb-4">
          Core Engineering Focus
        </h2>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
          <div class="bg-white border border-zinc-200 rounded-xl p-5 shadow-xs">
            <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-zinc-950 mb-1.5">Distributed Systems &amp; Go</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-zinc-600 leading-relaxed">
              Concurrency primitives, low-latency services, and predictable resource utilization.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-white border border-zinc-200 rounded-xl p-5 shadow-xs">
            <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-zinc-950 mb-1.5">WebRTC &amp; P2P Protocols</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-zinc-600 leading-relaxed">
              Signaling servers, SDP compression, and direct browser-to-browser data channels.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-white border border-zinc-200 rounded-xl p-5 shadow-xs">
            <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-zinc-950 mb-1.5">Databases &amp; Performance</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-zinc-600 leading-relaxed">
              PostgreSQL index internals, query planning, and stream-based data transformation.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-white border border-zinc-200 rounded-xl p-5 shadow-xs">
            <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-zinc-950 mb-1.5">Zero-Overhead Web</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-zinc-600 leading-relaxed">
              Static-first architectures, critical CSS extraction, and fast developer tooling.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>

    <!-- Right Column: Quick Facts & Contact -->
    <div class="lg:col-span-5 space-y-6">
      <!-- Quick Facts Card -->
      <section class="bg-white border border-zinc-200 rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-7 shadow-xs" aria-labelledby="quick-bio-heading">
        <h2 id="quick-bio-heading" class="text-xs font-mono font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-zinc-600 mb-4">
          Quick Bio
        </h2>
        <dl class="divide-y divide-zinc-100 text-sm">
          <div class="py-3 flex items-baseline justify-between gap-4">
            <dt class="font-mono text-xs text-zinc-600">Name</dt>
            <dd class="font-semibold text-zinc-950 text-right">Jirawat Boonkumnerd</dd>
          </div>
          <div class="py-3 flex items-baseline justify-between gap-4">
            <dt class="font-mono text-xs text-zinc-600">Email</dt>
            <dd class="text-right">
              <a class="text-blue-600 hover:underline font-mono text-xs font-medium" href="mailto:contact@ntsd.dev">
                contact@ntsd.dev
              </a>
            </dd>
          </div>
          <div class="py-3 flex items-baseline justify-between gap-4">
            <dt class="font-mono text-xs text-zinc-600">Website</dt>
            <dd class="text-right">
              <a class="text-blue-600 hover:underline font-mono text-xs font-medium" href="https://ntsd.dev">
                ntsd.dev
              </a>
            </dd>
          </div>
          <div class="py-3 flex items-baseline justify-between gap-4">
            <dt class="font-mono text-xs text-zinc-600">Location</dt>
            <dd class="text-zinc-950 font-medium text-right">Bangkok, Thailand</dd>
          </div>
        </dl>
      </section>

      <!-- Contact Section -->
      <section id="contact" class="bg-white border border-zinc-200 rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-7 shadow-xs">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold tracking-tight text-zinc-950 mb-2">Get in Touch</h2>
        <p class="text-sm text-zinc-600 mb-6 leading-relaxed">
          Reach out for technical discussions, open-source collaborations, or engineering inquiries.
        </p>

        <div class="space-y-3 mb-6">
          <a
            href="https://github.com/ntsd"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            target="_blank"
            class="craft-card p-3.5 rounded-xl border border-zinc-200 bg-zinc-50/50 hover:bg-white hover:border-zinc-300 flex items-center gap-3.5 group"
          >
            <div class="p-2.5 rounded-lg bg-zinc-200/70 text-zinc-900 group-hover:bg-zinc-950 group-hover:text-white transition-colors">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 fill-current" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
                <path d="M12.026 2C7.13295 1.99937 2.96183 5.54799 2.17842 10.3779C1.395 15.2079 4.23061 19.893 8.87302 21.439C9.37302 21.529 9.55202 21.222 9.55202 20.958C9.55202 20.721 9.54402 20.093 9.54102 19.258C6.76602 19.858 6.18002 17.92 6.18002 17.92C5.99733 17.317 5.60459 16.7993 5.07302 16.461C4.17302 15.842 5.14202 15.856 5.14202 15.856C5.78269 15.9438 6.34657 16.3235 6.66902 16.884C6.94195 17.3803 7.40177 17.747 7.94632 17.9026C8.49087 18.0583 9.07503 17.99 9.56902 17.713C9.61544 17.207 9.84055 16.7341 10.204 16.379C7.99002 16.128 5.66202 15.272 5.66202 11.449C5.64973 10.4602 6.01691 9.5043 6.68802 8.778C6.38437 7.91731 6.42013 6.97325 6.78802 6.138C6.78802 6.138 7.62502 5.869 9.53002 7.159C11.1639 6.71101 12.8882 6.71101 14.522 7.159C16.428 5.868 17.264 6.138 17.264 6.138C17.6336 6.97286 17.6694 7.91757 17.364 8.778C18.0376 9.50423 18.4045 10.4626 18.388 11.453C18.388 15.286 16.058 16.128 13.836 16.375C14.3153 16.8651 14.5612 17.5373 14.511 18.221C14.511 19.555 14.499 20.631 14.499 20.958C14.499 21.225 14.677 21.535 15.186 21.437C19.8265 19.8884 22.6591 15.203 21.874 10.3743C21.089 5.54565 16.9181 1.99888 12.026 2Z"></path>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <div class="text-xs font-mono text-zinc-600">GitHub</div>
              <div class="text-sm font-semibold text-zinc-950 group-hover:text-blue-600 transition-colors">github.com/ntsd</div>
            </div>
          </a>

          <a
            href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/ntsd"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            target="_blank"
            class="craft-card p-3.5 rounded-xl border border-zinc-200 bg-zinc-50/50 hover:bg-white hover:border-zinc-300 flex items-center gap-3.5 group"
          >
            <div class="p-2.5 rounded-lg bg-zinc-200/70 text-zinc-900 group-hover:bg-blue-600 group-hover:text-white transition-colors">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 fill-current" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
                <path d="M19 0h-14c-2.761 0-5 2.239-5 5v14c0 2.761 2.239 5 5 5h14c2.762 0 5-2.239 5-5v-14c0-2.761-2.238-5-5-5zm-11 19h-3v-11h3v11zm-1.5-12.268c-.966 0-1.75-.79-1.75-1.764s.784-1.764 1.75-1.764 1.75.79 1.75 1.764-.783 1.764-1.75 1.764zm13.5 12.268h-3v-5.604c0-3.368-4-3.113-4 0v5.604h-3v-11h3v1.765c1.396-2.586 7-2.777 7 2.476v6.759z"></path>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <div class="text-xs font-mono text-zinc-600">LinkedIn</div>
              <div class="text-sm font-semibold text-zinc-950 group-hover:text-blue-600 transition-colors">linkedin.com/in/ntsd</div>
            </div>
          </a>
        </div>

        <a
          href="mailto:contact@ntsd.dev"
          class="craft-button w-full inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 min-h-[48px] bg-zinc-950 hover:bg-zinc-800 text-white font-semibold py-3 px-6 rounded-lg shadow-xs text-sm"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
        >
          <span>Send Email to contact@ntsd.dev</span>
          <span aria-hidden="true" class="craft-arrow inline-block">&rarr;</span>
        </a>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</PageLayout>
